### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions
Accept: application/json

###

### List all sessions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a specific session (replace with actual ID)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Accept: application/json

###

### Create an exchange in a session (replace with actual ID)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID/exchanges
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="voice.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./voice.wav
------boundary--

###

### End a session (replace with actual ID)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID/end
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete a session (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Accept: application/json
